#. Description
#: ../po/debian-tasks.desc:2001
msgid "Development tools"
msgstr ""

#. Description
#: ../po/debian-tasks.desc:2001
msgid ""
"Compiler toolchain, version control, editors, and runtime diagnostic helpers "
"for software development on Athena.  Mirrors the content of config/pkg.list "
"[development-tools] — keep in sync when adding/removing packages."
msgstr ""

#. Description
#: ../po/debian-tasks.desc:3001
msgid "GNOME Desktop Environment"
msgstr ""

#. Description
#: ../po/debian-tasks.desc:3001
msgid ""
"Athena's GNOME desktop — shell, file manager, terminal, system settings, "
"browser, common GNOME apps + utilities, PIM stack (calendar/contacts/"
"clocks), software center, and admin GUI tools."
msgstr ""

#. Description
#: ../po/debian-tasks.desc:3001
msgid ""
"Derived from Debian's gnome-desktop task content (gnome-core + gnome meta) "
"merged with Athena-specific additions (firefox-esr as default browser, gnome-"
"screenshot, Noto+DejaVu fonts). Mirrors the content of config/pkg.list "
"[gnome-desktop] — keep in sync when adding/removing packages."
msgstr ""

#. Description
#: ../po/debian-tasks.desc:6001
msgid "standard system utilities"
msgstr "සම්මත පද්ධති උපයෝගීතා"

#. Description
#: ../po/debian-tasks.desc:6001
msgid ""
"A curated set of command-line utilities that Athena installs by default.  "
"Derivative of Debian's \"standard\" task but uses an explicit Key: list "
"(Athena-chosen) rather than the broad \"Packages: standard\" Priority "
"sigil.  Operator who wants any Debian-standard package not listed here can "
"apt-install individually post-install — they're all available in /cdrom/pool."
msgstr ""

#~ msgid ""
#~ "This task sets up a basic user environment, providing a reasonably small "
#~ "selection of services and tools usable on the command line."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "මෙම කාර්යය මූලික පරිශීලක පරිසරයක් සකසනයි. එය විධාන රේඛාවේ අඩුවෙන් භාවිත කල හැකි සේවා "
#~ "හා මෙවලම් අඩු ප්‍රමාණයක් ලබාදෙයි."

#~ msgid "manual package selection"
#~ msgstr "ක්‍රමික පැකේජ තෝරාගැනීම"

#~ msgid "Manually select packages to install in aptitude."
#~ msgstr "යෝග්‍යතාවේදී ස්ථාපනය කරන පැකේජ ශ්‍රමිකව තෝරන්න."
